-# How to get here. The generic version knows only the street address, which is
-# a fact; transit lines, parking and which door to use are editorial, and every
-# house's are different. Override this whole partial in your theme -- see
-# sites/example/README.md -- and say the useful things.
-#
-# With no address configured there is nothing to print, so the heading goes too
-# rather than introducing an empty section.
- if theater_info.full_address.present?
  %h5 Getting Here
  %p= "#{theater_info.name} is located at #{theater_info.full_address}."
